// =============================================================================
// made-in-time-course — "Made in Time: Ages, the Mind, and the War for It"
// =============================================================================
// Darrell 2026-07-16: "more substantial lessons ... its own course ... all
// lessons should also tie in ... clarify what age certain people are and what
// their neurochemistry would be at, compared to how neuroscientists explain the
// brain's processing centers, and how the enemy may have been importing
// strategies because of our human design and lack of knowledge about Yahweh's
// authority, strength and honour, or the eternal family and those who know."
//
// A self-paced course (rides the same shared Learn engine as Living Lessons) that
// walks the biblical TIMELINE through one lens: Yahweh made us to grow through
// TIME -- by ages and stages -- and the brain He designed matures by stages too.
// The adversary studies that design and our LACK OF KNOWLEDGE and imports strategy
// against it; the defense is a renewed mind and KNOWING our God. Every lesson ties
// back to the timeline epochs (lib/biblical-timeline.js) and to the other lessons.
//
// THE DISCIPLINES THIS COURSE HOLDS (binding):
//  - WORD-FIRST (DR-0098): the Word is the authority; neuroscience is a WITNESS to
//    His design, never over it -- the house's third-witness.js pattern.
//  - THREE-TIER HONESTY (DR-0100 / ACCESS-TO-THE-HUMAN-MIND): established science
//    is stated plainly and CITED (Arain et al. 2013 on prefrontal maturation to
//    ~mid-20s; Dr. Tracey Marks on dopamine/amygdala) -- reused from the repo, not
//    re-derived; a SPECIFIC biblical figure's "neurochemistry" is named as
//    INFERENCE, never asserted; ideological over-reach is corrected by the Word.
//  - THE ENEMY IS BOUNDED, OUTSIDE-IN (ACCESS-TO-THE-HUMAN-MIND, binding): the
//    adversary does not read thoughts, is not omniscient, and does not reach in
//    and change brain chemistry. He works by SUGGESTION, exploiting what is
//    already present (real desire, real fear, still-forming judgment) and our
//    lack of knowledge. "Suggestion + agreement = entry." And NOT every thought
//    is the enemy -- much is simply the flesh (Mark 7:21-23); attributing every
//    impulse to him is itself an error. The governing question is not "what has
//    access?" but "what GOVERNS?"
//  - NO FABRICATION (DR-0076): ages ONLY where Scripture states them (Joseph 17/30,
//    Jesus 12/~30, Josiah 8/16, David "a youth"); where an age is NOT given (e.g.
//    Mary), the course says so rather than inventing it. Every verse is KJV,
//    fetched verbatim from app/public/bible/kjv.
//  - DOCTRINE IS SME-OWNED (ARI-PERSONA): the spiritual-warfare frame follows the
//    house's settled ACCESS-TO-THE-HUMAN-MIND + MIND-OF-CHRIST docs; the
//    divine-council / power-asymmetry material (THE-ROOT-OPEN-INVESTIGATIONS) is
//    UNRATIFIED and is not leaned on here. Contested edges -> Darrell / Bishop Gwin.
//  - TYPOGRAPHY (CLAUDE.md): God references capitalized; the adversary never.
//
// Ships like any content, reviewed LIVE on production (DR-0104). Grows as the
// house teaches more.
// =============================================================================

