        'Fractured attention is PROGRAMMED, not just weak willpower -- the RAS filter bribed, self-control failing at the attention level, novelty like gambling, autopilot habit, the idle mind’s drift. Lesson 3’s enemy, on the attention frontline.',
        'Held rightly (ACCESS-TO-THE-HUMAN-MIND): real mechanisms exploited outside-in; NOT every distraction is a demon -- much is the dopamine design + our habit.',
        'Guard the gates: "Keep thy heart with all diligence... Let thine eyes look right on" (Proverbs 4:23-25); "I will set no wicked thing before mine eyes" (Psalm 101:3); the eye is the window (Matthew 6:22-23).',
        'Replace, don’t just resist: renew the mind (Romans 12:2) and seek a HIGHER satisfaction in God -- fill the room; detox-by-willpower alone fails.',
